{
  "schema": "stellar-forge.distribution-source-selection.v1",
  "id": "grant-operations",
  "title": "Grant Operations",
  "description": "Case-linked grant planning with retained save recovery, exact-revision amendments, delivery calendars, editable XLSX and source-table handover, returned-workbook receiving through browser, CLI and Merchant MCP. Native baseline reviews, contributor agreements and availability, timesheets, invoices, CSV/OFX/QFX/MT940 statements, reconciliation, currencies and sourced FX, forecasts and resource portfolios. Merchant settlement corrections, period-close cash attribution, customer installations and receiver-to-owner return review, milestone billing, implementation evidence, measured cohorts and portable cases. Named financial desks retain complete inputs and actions through sign-in recovery, earlier copies and restored installations. Issued buyer expenses and credits retain accountant sources, native-unit allocation and reviewed valuation. Reviewed CUSTOMER expense portions can prepare source-backed native billing, preserve explicit customer terms and buyer credit review, and recover original draft/issue/correction commands with complete case export and receiving. Accepted CUSTOMER Work can retain explicit hourly authority, contributor/package rate scopes, per-line rounding and whole-authority caps, then prepare and recover native customer invoices, corrections and complete case receiving. Quantity reservations coordinate case copies in the same Operations workspace.",
